{"name":"Diva Mecha","hex":"#ee99ee","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"diva","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any female celebrity, usually a well known singer or actress. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","A person with an inflated sense of self, who has high expectations of others, and who is extremely demanding and fussy when it comes to personal privileges."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/diva"},{"term":"mecha","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A large armoured robot on legs, typically controlled by a pilot seated inside."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/mecha"}],"entries":[{"title":"Diva","blocks":[{"text":"Diva, the Latin word for a goddess, has often been used as an honorific to refer to a celebrated woman of outstanding talent in the world of opera, theatre, cinema, fashion and popular music. If referring to an actress, the meaning of diva is closely related to that of prima donna. Diva can also refer to a person, especially one in show business, with a reputation for being temperamental or demanding. The application of the term has broadened beyond the performing arts to also include celebrated political and business figures."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Mariah_Carey_-_Beautiful_%28Live_%40_GMA%2C_May_24%2C_2013%29.JPG/330px-Mariah_Carey_-_Beautiful_%28Live_%40_GMA%2C_May_24%2C_2013%29.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diva","wikidata":"Q867132"},{"title":"Mecha","blocks":[{"text":"In science fiction, mecha  or mechs are giant robots or machines, either depicted as piloted or sentient and are typically humanoid walking vehicles. The term was first used in Japanese after shortening the English loanword 'mechanism'  or 'mechanical' , but the meaning in Japanese is more inclusive, meaning any mechanism in general, and 'robot'  or 'giant robot' is the narrower term referring to robots."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/%E3%82%AF%E3%83%A9%E3%82%BF%E3%82%B9%E3%83%BBMaker_Faire_Tokyo_2012_%281%29.jpg/330px-%E3%82%AF%E3%83%A9%E3%82%BF%E3%82%B9%E3%83%BBMaker_Faire_Tokyo_2012_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mecha","wikidata":"Q858784"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/%E5%95%A6%E5%95%A6%E5%AF%B6%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E9%87%91%E6%A9%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%AB%98%E9%81%94%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B_%28Cropped%29.jpg/500px-%E5%95%A6%E5%95%A6%E5%AF%B6%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E9%87%91%E6%A9%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%AB%98%E9%81%94%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B_%28Cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/%E5%95%A6%E5%95%A6%E5%AF%B6%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E9%87%91%E6%A9%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%AB%98%E9%81%94%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B_%28Cropped%29.jpg/1280px-%E5%95%A6%E5%95%A6%E5%AF%B6%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E9%87%91%E6%A9%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%AB%98%E9%81%94%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B_%28Cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/%E5%95%A6%E5%95%A6%E5%AF%B6%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E9%87%91%E6%A9%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%AB%98%E9%81%94%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B_%28Cropped%29.jpg/500px-%E5%95%A6%E5%95%A6%E5%AF%B6%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E9%87%91%E6%A9%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%AB%98%E9%81%94%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B_%28Cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A statue of the Freedom Gundam from Mobile Suit Gundam SEED in Shanghai","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A%E5%95%A6%E5%95%A6%E5%AF%B6%E9%83%BD%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E9%87%91%E6%A9%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%AB%98%E9%81%94%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B_(Cropped).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Strike_Suit_Z